  "description": "This Sicilian dish of eggplant and other vegetables sautéed in a sweet and sour sauce is shockingly flavorful. Packed with extra-virgin olive oil, raisins, pine nuts, herbs, vinegar, sugar, and a slew of other ingredients, it's the kind of dish you have to recalibrate your whole mouth for in order to really appreciate.",
